# All optional — the app falls back to the pilot taskboard project's public
# values (safe to expose; every table is protected by RLS). Override only if
# you want to point the app at your own separate Supabase project instead
# (create one at https://supabase.com, apply migrations/*.sql via its SQL
# Editor, then fill these in from Project Settings → API).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
